diff --git a/ChangeLog b/ChangeLog
index 2ee8bc0a..ae1346a9 100644
--- a/ChangeLog
+++ b/ChangeLog
@@ -11,6 +11,12 @@ Release date: TBA
 
 * astroid has been upgraded to 2.6.0
 
+* pyreverse now uses type annotations (PEP 484) of class and instance attributes,
+  including the annotations of the ``__init__`` arguments they are assigned from.
+  Attributes annotated with a type but defaulting to ``None`` are shown as ``Optional[...]``.
+
+  Closes #1548
+
 * Fix false positive ``useless-type-doc`` on ignored argument using ``pylint.extensions.docparams``
   when a function was typed using pep484 but not inside the docstring.
 
